TI  - Chronic Inflammatory Disease in the Pancreas, Kidney and Salivary Glands of English Cocker Spaniels and Dogs of Other Breeds Shows Similar Histological Features to Human IgG4-related Disease
T2  - JOURNAL OF COMPARATIVE PATHOLOGY
